    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "CoQ10 functions as an essential cofactor in the electron transport chain, facilitating ATP production. It also acts as a potent antioxidant, reducing oxidative stress and protecting mitochondrial and neuronal membranes from damage. These mechanisms support energy metabolism and neuroprotection, which may contribute to psychiatric and neurological benefits."
    },
